{
  "slug": "naksha-studio",
  "name": "Naksha Studio",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A virtual design team for Claude Code, Cursor, Windsurf, Gemini CLI, and Copilot — 18 roles, 32 commands, 11,000+ lines of expert design knowledge. Your agency's design brain, inside your terminal.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **7 agents**, **63 commands** and **3 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `design` (Assembles a virtual design team to produce production-quality UI, UX, visual, social media, email, and data output)\n- **Agents** (7): `accessibility-auditor` (Use this agent to run a comprehensive WCAG AA accessibility audit on a design), `design-critic` (Use this agent to run a structured 3-pass UX critique — heuristics, accessibility, and content quality), `design-critique` (Use this agent to perform an automated UX heuristic review of Figma screens), `design-lint` (Use this agent to lint a Figma file for common design issues — inconsistent spacing, orphan colors, non-standard…), `design-qa` (Use this agent to run visual QA on a design implementation — checking responsive behavior across breakpoints, token/design…), `design-token-extractor` (Use this agent to extract design tokens from CSS, SCSS, JavaScript, or Tailwind config files), `figma-creator` (Use this agent to create visual designs directly in Figma using the Desktop Bridge)\n- **Commands** (63): `ab-variants` (Generate A/B test design variants from an existing Figma screen — alternate layouts, CTA placements, color treatments, and…), `accessibility-audit` (Full WCAG AA accessibility audit on an HTML file — contrast ratios, keyboard navigation, semantic HTML, ARIA usage,…), `brand-kit` (Generate a complete brand kit from a logo and 1-2 brand colors — full palette, type scale, icon…), `brand-strategy` (Define or audit a brand — positioning, visual identity system, voice and tone, and brand architecture), `chart-design` (Design a chart or data visualization — selects the right chart type, applies accessible color palettes, adds annotations,…), `competitive-audit` (Capture a competitor website with Playwright and extract its color system, typography, layout patterns, and 'steal this' recommendations), `component-docs` (Auto-generate component documentation from Figma — props, variants, usage guidelines, spacing specs, and code snippets in Storybook-style format), `dashboard-layout` (Design and build a complete dashboard layout — sidebar navigation, KPI cards, chart areas, data tables, filter bar,…), and 55 more\n- **Hooks** (3): `SessionStart`, `Stop`, `PreToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install naksha-studio@claude-community` from `Adityaraj0421/naksha-studio`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
